{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Is Honey is a cozy idle game where you collect and care for over 150+ types of bees. Each bee has a unique look and boosts your honey production and profits. Unlock and customize hives, then upgrade to complete your bee collection, including special golden bees.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140570/extras/5615d38e0b480066e130f4c66b1d66dd.avif?t=1757945603\" width=630 height=118 /></span>Discover over <strong>150+ unique bees</strong>, each with its own adorable appearance and stats that increase your profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140570/extras/13f98925e988068fd66336794b4db830.poster.avif?t=1757945603\" width=630 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140570/extras/13f98925e988068fd66336794b4db830.webm?t=1757945603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140570/extras/a4cd2b27d10bf3e47f3e168b3283e493.avif?t=1757945603\" width=630 height=118 /></span>Nurture and <strong>feed your bees</strong> with love and care. <strong>Watch your hive grow bigger and bigger</strong> and enjoy the honey they produce as your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140570/extras/798eaeee11c08295711d367aeaaad869.poster.avif?t=1757945603\" width=630 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c